ComfyUI ABG Model Analytics

Based on the idea and architecture of ComfyUI-Model-Analytics by Bennowan:
https://github.com/Bennowan/ComfyUI-Model-Analytics
Reference revision: dec3926e6cb7c407ca3a5066f7309e3925e3cb22

Credit to Bennowan for the original model inventory, workflow analytics, and
successful-load tracking extension. This personal version implements its own
inventory, per-file usage database, workflow-reference tracking, configurable
trash moves, restore journal, and frontend.

The upstream LICENSE requires prominent attribution and restricts derivatives
to non-commercial use. Those conditions are retained here. The upstream
pyproject.toml says MIT, but its actual License file adds a non-commercial
restriction; this project does not represent that license as standard MIT.
